            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">Inventory refers to the production of 1 kg soybean oil, respectively soybean meal (incl. hulls). The multioutput-process 'soybeans, in oil mill' delivers the co-products 'soybean oil, at oil mill' and 'soybean meal, at oil mill'. Economic allocation with allocation factor of 40.7% to oil and 59.3 to meal. Allocation is done according to carbon balance for CO2 emissions.;
